@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统：订单生命周期
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

state "交易与商家履约" as TradeStage {
  state "待付款" as PendingPayment
  state "待商家接单" as AwaitingMerchant
  state "制作中" as Preparing
}
state "配送准备" as PreparationStage {
  state "待分配配送" as AwaitingAssignment
  state "待配送员接单" as AwaitingCourier
  state "待取餐" as AwaitingPickup
}
state "配送与交付" as DeliveryStage {
  state "配送中" as Delivering
  state "配送异常" as DeliveryException
  state "已送达" as Delivered
  state ExceptionDecision <<choice>>
}
state "已完成" as Completed
state "已取消" as Cancelled

' 订单状态取值为三个分组内的业务状态以及已完成、已取消；分组和分支不作为取值。
[*] --> PendingPayment
PendingPayment --> AwaitingMerchant : 付款成功
AwaitingMerchant --> Preparing : 商家接单
Preparing --> AwaitingAssignment : 备餐完成
AwaitingAssignment --> AwaitingCourier : 派单 [无待审取消申请]
AwaitingCourier --> AwaitingPickup : 配送接单 [无其他进行中任务]
AwaitingPickup --> Delivering : 确认取餐 [无待审取消申请]
Delivering --> Delivered : 确认送达
Delivered --> Completed : 确认完成
Delivered --> Completed : after(24小时) [无未处理异常]

PendingPayment --> Cancelled : 直接取消
PendingPayment --> Cancelled : after(10分钟) [未付款]
AwaitingMerchant --> Cancelled : 直接取消
AwaitingMerchant --> Cancelled : 拒单
AwaitingMerchant --> Cancelled : after(5分钟) [未接单]
AwaitingMerchant --> Cancelled : 平台终止履约
Preparing --> Cancelled : 取消决定生效
AwaitingAssignment --> Cancelled : 取消决定生效
AwaitingCourier --> Cancelled : 取消决定生效
AwaitingPickup --> Cancelled : 取消决定生效

AwaitingCourier --> AwaitingAssignment : 拒接
AwaitingCourier --> AwaitingAssignment : after(3分钟) [未响应]
AwaitingCourier --> AwaitingCourier : 改派
AwaitingPickup --> AwaitingPickup : 改派
Delivering --> Delivering : 改派 [已交接]
Delivering --> DeliveryException : 报告异常
Delivering --> Cancelled : 确认终止
DeliveryException --> ExceptionDecision : 处置决定
ExceptionDecision --> Delivering : [继续配送或交接]
ExceptionDecision --> Cancelled : [终止]

Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
